Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.06,0:00:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running, forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.08,0:00:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is calling out, so ride the waves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.94,0:00:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all together as one,\Nso let's sail in the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.66,0:00:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,All our dreams are never ending, so\Nlet's wake up, wake up, wake up, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.94,0:00:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Heartbeat, we will be one! Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.54,0:00:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though our hearts have\Ntraveled different paths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.64,0:00:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We are best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.26,0:00:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Our freedom is our only compass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.10,0:00:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's pointing us along the\Nmany roads that come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We will keep on running forward every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.60,0:00:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Go east, go west.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.96,0:00:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we keep looking to the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.74,0:00:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see everything all crystal clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.60,0:00:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all so thrilled that we\Ncan't wait until the dawn arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.02,0:00:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So we'll just bring the\Nsun ourselves to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If the winds blow, we're waiting\Nwhere we should be going, go?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.64,0:01:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. We're\Nshining, running forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.28,0:01:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All of our dreams will\Nmerge into one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.34,0:01:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where we go,\Nwe'll be fine and free.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.06,0:01:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause all our treasure is our strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.78,0:01:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.38,0:01:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is coming out, so ride the wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.22,0:01:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all together as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.62,0:01:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's just stay with the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.10,0:01:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,While our dreams are never ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.24,0:01:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Heartbeat, we will be one, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.24,0:01:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,My darkness will swallow the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.22,0:01:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.34,0:01:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'll lose to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.32,0:01:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be king of the pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.80,0:01:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger's treasure belongs to me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.44,0:01:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll ride non-stop and travel farther
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.70,0:01:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,than we've ever gone And then tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.70,0:01:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,we will find suspense And then commence\Nto live out another day so intense
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.54,0:02:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.28,0:02:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Running forever. Let's go along\Nwith curiosity. Our feelings lead
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.32,0:02:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,the way straight to a brand new day Into\Nanother adventure Come on, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.22,0:02:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,running forever Open the map inside your\Nheart and see No matter where we end up,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.86,0:02:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,our mods will never give up There's a fire\Nin our dreams And you can never, never,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.48,0:02:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,never, never stop it We\Nwill be one, go ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.06,0:02:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Where now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.94,0:02:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.96,0:02:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,There's an underground tunnel that\Nconnects Greenbit to Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.98,0:02:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We finally made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.82,0:02:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There's the airport!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.10,0:02:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.30,0:02:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is way nicer than I expected!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.44,0:02:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness, isn't that cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.10,0:02:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yellow Caboo 43 buzzing in!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.18,0:02:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready for takeoff!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.92,0:03:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yellow Caboo 43, you're\Ncleared for takeoff!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.46,0:03:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Pink Bee Squad here,\Nwe're ready when you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.14,0:03:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger that, Pink Bee!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.64,0:03:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,All bug units stand by\Nfor further instruction!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.18,0:03:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and Usulin, please watch your step among\Nthe aircraft. Oh, sorry. Hey, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.66,0:03:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.48,0:03:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.46,0:03:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.28,0:03:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Preparation's complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.74,0:03:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's take to the air, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.06,0:03:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, okay? Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.08,0:03:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is exactly what our squad members\Nhave been tirelessly training to tackle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.42,0:03:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This is definitely a first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.52,0:03:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta show Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.42,0:03:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You aren't as compact as we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.58,0:03:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have to hop aboard our special\N20-passenger buses, if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.80,0:03:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.00,0:03:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Linear foxes, please report in. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.08,0:04:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.66,0:04:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna ride in style.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.04,0:04:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They're really fast, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.20,0:04:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Such beautiful fur.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.68,0:04:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to take flight, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.40,0:04:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,With Usuland beside us,\Nthere's no way we can lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.24,0:04:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll bring our friends back\Nand Princess Monchery, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.22,0:04:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.52,0:04:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose I should explain\Nwhy we want to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.42,0:04:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing in there, perv?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.48,0:04:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,She's got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.00,0:04:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, at your service.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.24,0:04:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And thank you for the best\Nseat on the bus, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.82,0:04:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you're generous enough to\Nlay down your lives for our cause,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.26,0:05:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,there's something that I\Nthink you should know first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.74,0:05:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't remember promising that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.58,0:05:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo has caused a great deal of\Nsuffering, especially for the Tantata tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.10,0:05:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But our troubled\Nrelationship with his group
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.52,0:05:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,actually began long before\Nhe took over the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.64,0:05:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, the beginning of this sad\Ntale stretches back over 900 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.12,0:05:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.96,0:05:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Here in Dressrosa, there grows\Na vast field of sunflowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.98,0:05:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And somewhere, nestled among those\Nblooms, in an unknown location,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.64,0:05:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,there is a secret entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.74,0:05:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow the winding spiral\Nstaircase deep into the ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.46,0:05:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,and a cacophony of excited\Nvoices can be heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.74,0:05:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to introduce you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.74,0:05:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.70,0:05:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We've waited so long!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.34,0:06:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We're glad you finally made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.20,0:06:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you. At ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.20,0:06:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.48,0:06:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's that Tom Tump-looking guy, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.58,0:06:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be great to have a big\Nperson like him on our side, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.86,0:06:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way we'll lose the battle now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.32,0:06:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are the little people from Tontata.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.32,0:06:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They will be fighting\NDoflamingo with us. Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.08,0:06:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They're more of a threat than\Nyou might think, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.14,0:06:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,They move so fast,\Nthey're almost invisible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.96,0:06:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The townspeople call them fairies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.32,0:06:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.23,0:06:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, so when Zorro's\Nsword disappeared before...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.30,0:06:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.46,0:06:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you wanted to\Nget back to your ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.18,0:06:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.09,0:06:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, Luffy, get it together!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.68,0:06:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Young man, will you please sit down? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.18,0:06:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That sneaky little bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.08,0:06:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a fighting competition\Nand he doesn't bother telling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.44,0:06:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I could have cleaned up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.74,0:06:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Commander! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.62,0:06:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You're here too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.82,0:06:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just as surprised to see you, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.22,0:06:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.42,0:07:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We've already reviewed the\Nintel from the scouting unit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.62,0:07:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We know everything that Sugar and\Nthe enemy have been up to, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.22,0:07:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And, as it turns out, just in time for\Nour big confrontation with Doflamingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.74,0:07:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Also,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.65,0:07:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,some legendary heroes have appeared in our
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.86,0:07:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,kingdom and they're\Ngoing to help us fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.78,0:07:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, their names are Usaland and Robaland!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.30,0:07:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They're on their way here as we speak!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.98,0:07:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And they've got a whole group\Nof friends here with them, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.94,0:07:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.38,0:07:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It says their names are Luffy-Land,\NZora-Land, Nami-Land, Son-Land, Chopper-Land,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.82,0:07:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Fra-Land, and Bone-Land!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.38,0:07:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.06,0:07:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the best he could come up with?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.24,0:07:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, okay, I'm Zora-Land, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.04,0:07:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm the famous Fra-Land,\Nhere to save the day!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.02,0:07:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.10,0:07:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.66,0:07:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to get back to the\Nsunny before it's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.94,0:07:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I have been saying that this whole time!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.62,0:07:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.38,0:07:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't stifle my artistic expression.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.28,0:08:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, blow, kung fu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.14,0:08:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.94,0:08:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, two can play that game.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.68,0:08:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Try my weather icon for size.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.82,0:08:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Snow clouds fill the sky now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.30,0:08:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, my poor climate attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.26,0:08:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You turned it into some weird toy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.78,0:08:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,My oh my!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.44,0:08:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to flatter me,\Nmy dear. Like I would!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.56,0:08:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, as beautiful as it may be,\Nthat staff of yours is not a toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.00,0:08:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Make no mistake! Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.30,0:08:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,there is a Devil Fruit\Nuser in the Don Quixote
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.52,0:08:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,family who can transform people into toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.62,0:08:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I possess the power of the\Nart art fruit, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.44,0:08:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The masterpieces I create\Naren't toys at all. Huh? Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.32,0:08:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami can't fight her!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.26,0:08:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And with bunny rabbits for hooves,\Nthere's not much I can do either.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.98,0:08:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me, I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.68,0:09:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't let her take me away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.64,0:09:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll have to pry you\Nfrom my cold, dead hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.44,0:09:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, unfortunately.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.98,0:09:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,With no guitar, that might\Nbe a very real possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.36,0:09:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You act as though this\Nis some sort of tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.10,0:09:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be thrilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.70,0:09:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm making you art.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.66,0:09:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your doing, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.98,0:09:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You were the ones who went\Nand obliterated my submarine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.26,0:09:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My poor henchmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.50,0:09:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I must avenge them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.28,0:09:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I guarantee you, your death\Nwill be quite the spectacle!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.40,0:09:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, it's Chopper! Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.96,0:09:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever you are, we need your help!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.02,0:09:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Please hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.08,0:09:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Who told you you could answer that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.52,0:09:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Raccoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.06,0:09:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever your situation is, I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.30,0:09:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.21,0:09:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Traffy! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.70,0:09:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello, law.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.02,0:09:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What would you say that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.10,0:09:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Come help us, you jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.02,0:10:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to explain, but we're\Nartwork now, and it's just terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.12,0:10:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm all right, but please come.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.06,0:10:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, take the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.80,0:10:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And head for Greenbit now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.06,0:10:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to leave Caesar with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.50,0:10:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Just come to Greenbit. Calic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.52,0:10:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How could he hang up like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.78,0:10:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought he already gave them, Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.10,0:10:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't even listen\Nto what we had to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.70,0:10:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It was just like talking to Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.60,0:10:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.34,0:10:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the end of the line, Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.16,0:10:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Who did you just call?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.34,0:10:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Might as well go ahead and\Ngive me Caesar's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.26,0:10:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't you done enough scurrying\Naround like a miserable rat?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.28,0:11:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I set a trap for your little partner,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.16,0:11:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,and wouldn't you know it, that\Ngenius has walked right into it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.08,0:11:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew he wouldn't be able to resist that\Ngladiator contest at Corita Coliseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.54,0:11:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,All the competitors are dangerous\Noutlaws ready to fight to the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.10,0:11:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stepping into the\Nring is a suicide mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.98,0:11:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat doesn't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.14,0:11:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they're scraping\Nhim off the wall as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.58,0:11:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Your alliance has fallen apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.94,0:11:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.12,0:11:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready to give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.12,0:12:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight valiantly, Sir Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.90,0:12:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time for spectating, but he\Nmustn't lose his honor is at stake after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.56,0:12:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Buggy. I heard things\Nwere heating up around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.16,0:12:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, hey, who's the small fry?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.66,0:12:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Now for my Gum-Gum Hawk Rifle!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.32,0:12:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.02,0:13:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah-ho-ho, not bad for a twerp.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.66,0:13:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,All I gotta do is win Ace's fruit,\Nso I'm not done yet. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.12,0:13:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo-ho-ho, now that's a good joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.64,0:13:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no chance. Give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.38,0:13:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but\Nchildren drunk on infamy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.20,0:13:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They call you the worst generation,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.48,0:13:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,but you're not strong enough to sail across\Nthe ocean your forebearers fought upon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.86,0:13:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,After Whitebeard's death,\Nit was the end of an era.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.80,0:13:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.71,0:13:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,the only pirate from your generation with
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.58,0:13:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,even a sliver of\Npotential is Blackbeard T.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.20,0:13:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Blackbeard?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.11,0:13:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, perhaps time will tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.42,0:13:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But face it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.94,0:13:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're only able to match me in terms\Nof strength in my current lowly state,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.48,0:13:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,you don't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.12,0:13:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Just throw in the towel already.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.98,0:13:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I already said, you're\Nnot a shabby opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.92,0:13:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But if Rayleigh chose a brat like you\Nas a flag bearer for the new generation,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.40,0:14:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,he's not as sharp as he used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.80,0:14:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy, on the other\Nhand, they were wise.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.98,0:14:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire Fist, he had the devil's\Nblood flowing in his veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.50,0:14:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They stamped him just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.86,0:14:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you can beat the Navy\NAdmirals and four Emperors?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.36,0:14:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And somehow surpass\NRoger's legacy as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.12,0:14:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make me laugh. No one can.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.54,0:14:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.82,0:14:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Then just watch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.34,0:14:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum ROCKET! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.06,0:14:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he flying?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.96,0:14:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What an incredibly high leap!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.42,0:14:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.82,0:14:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for your final lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.78,0:14:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been holding onto 30\Nyears of rage towards Garp.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.08,0:14:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's time to collect, Straw Hats,\Nin the form of an Alto KO Skull Smash!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.10,0:14:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.08,0:14:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on with this ice?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.10,0:14:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't melt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.32,0:15:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Axes won't break it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.62,0:15:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.84,0:15:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course there's an unbelievable\Namount of pirate treasure under it,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.36,0:15:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,just out of our reach!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.66,0:15:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, ho ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.20,0:15:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You could try for a hundred years.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.16,0:15:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't make a scratch\Nin the ice with those tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.30,0:15:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to shatter it, then you must\Napply tremendous pressure in one spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.60,0:15:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Drill, Dragoneel!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.78,0:15:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.52,0:15:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Open, Chinchou!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.90,0:16:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Boys tie up these wannabe treasure thieves\Nand throw them into the ocean. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.48,0:16:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.42,0:16:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So many riches—the entirety of my life's
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.72,0:16:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,work is held safely\Nwithin this cage of ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.60,0:16:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope for the future, joy\Nand sorrow of the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.36,0:16:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,all told in centuries worth\Nof my family's treasures.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.62,0:16:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And the only key to the\Nroom is my drill head.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.72,0:16:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Without it, there's no way to get.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.78,0:16:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,get
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.66,0:16:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.57,0:16:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody can invade my\Nsanctuary, not even the Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.04,0:16:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Today's the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.10,0:16:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been doing some
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.28,0:16:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,training to found in that big\Nhead of yours, Ching Chow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.92,0:16:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Polarized eight mountains down to sand to
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.30,0:16:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,get ready for this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.42,0:16:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.56,0:16:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Your bluster and no bite, Garp.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.10,0:16:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing in the world\Nthat's harder than my head!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.82,0:16:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Drill, get ready to eat those words.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.36,0:17:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This mighty head of mine\Nwill split your fist in two!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.82,0:17:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.00,0:17:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.24,0:17:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He actually did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.86,0:17:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.58,0:17:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh shit, it's set sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.02,0:17:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You had us scared for a second there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.48,0:17:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I said open Xin Zhao
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.50,0:17:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Drill, drag, and nail
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.22,0:18:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Open Xin Zhao. Just open up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.40,0:18:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't open
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.00,0:18:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What can I do? All my\Ntreasure lost. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.04,0:18:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,in front of me just\Nout of reach everything
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.36,0:18:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,i've worked for sealed\Naway an endless fortune
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.54,0:18:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you, God. You will\Npay for this curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.96,0:18:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,your children and grandchildren to curse
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.12,0:18:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,you for all eternity
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.18,0:18:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,bastard a short time
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.48,0:18:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,after that I retired gave up pirating my
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.80,0:18:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,power was gone and my\Nheart broken into pieces
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.16,0:18:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.12,0:18:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I hallucinating?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.34,0:19:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy's arm is implanted like a balloon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.26,0:19:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Witness me, Garp.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.64,0:19:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm about to take your\Nprecious grandson's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.80,0:19:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.72,0:19:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.88,0:19:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,it's time for you to pay for\Nyour old man's right hook
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.60,0:19:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,that took everything away\Nfrom me and destroyed my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.38,0:19:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,A punch?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.58,0:19:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you're so bent out of shape?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.46,0:19:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.40,0:19:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even remember how many\Ntimes I got slugged by him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.80,0:19:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll finish the job and\Npulverize every bone in your body!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.66,0:19:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ashokan, Jack Peek!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.88,0:19:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready for my Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.08,0:19:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Non-drill dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.36,0:19:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Elephant gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.84,0:19:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Non-nail!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.22,0:20:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Gramps, are you dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.24,0:20:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, he's out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.22,0:20:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Xin Zhao is eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.44,0:20:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This round's winner is Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.58,0:20:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This is simply remarkable!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.12,0:20:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He bested a living legend!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.60,0:20:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,After a hard-fought battle, we\Nhave a champion for Block Z!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.16,0:20:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hear it for Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.60,0:20:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.82,0:20:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I admit I never expected\Nhim to go this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.50,0:20:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Who can have predicted a\Nsurprise ending like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.02,0:20:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to all those idiots cheer him on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.66,0:20:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of this Lucy crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.70,0:21:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Even under a false name,\Nhe gets the limelight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.20,0:21:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But now that the match\Nis done, you're mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.80,0:21:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And this time, you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.62,0:21:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you deaf, Cavendish?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.78,0:21:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to let you touch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.24,0:21:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No freaking way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.60,0:21:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You get in my way and I'll\Nkill you as well, Bartolomeo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.64,0:21:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to see you try!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.12,0:21:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one to kill Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.30,0:21:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He coupled a legend, but can\Nhe hold on to this momentum?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.92,0:21:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And if not Lucy,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.50,0:21:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,who will go on to win the championship\Nand take home the flame flame fruit?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.54,0:21:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.50,0:21:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This should be interesting.
